      "writtenOn": "2023-03-31T17:48:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Remove the unit \u0026 mock `clock_enable_module` totally.\n\nThe zephyr would not be able to build, and the whole build system becomes very fragile after we mock the clock_enable_module.\n\nI don\u0027t think it\u0027s worth spending so much effort on writing a unit test for a simple class.",
